{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25482","headline":"思平泉树石杂咏一十首 白鹭鹚 · 李德裕","name":"思平泉树石杂咏一十首 白鹭鹚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"余心怜白鹭，潭上日相依。\n拂石疑星落，凌风似雪飞。\n碧沙常独立，清景自忘归。\n所乐惟烟水，徘徊恋钓矶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25482.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25482","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}